## Why This Is Asked
The question tests building a real-time, multilingual NLP system with strict latency, code-switching handling, and robust evaluation. It also probes deployment discipline and drift monitoring.

## Key Concepts
- Streaming NLP pipelines
- Multilingual encoders for NER/RE
- Code-switching and domain terms
- Latency governance, canary rollouts, drift dashboards

## Code Example
